## Why This Is Asked
Tests privacy-conscious OTCA design, multi-tenant residency, and deletion rights in a real-world, cross-region telemetry pipeline.

## Key Concepts
- PII redaction and tokenization at ingress
- Tenant opt-in/out governance and regional routing
- Immutable audit logs for compliance
- Deletion requests via tombstones with cross-region propagation
- End-to-end testing including opt-out, deletion, and reconciliation

## Code Example
```javascript
function redactPII(event) {
  const e = {...event};
  if (e.payload?.email) e.payload.email = 'REDACTED';
  if (e.payload?.phone) e.payload.phone = 'REDACTED';
  return e;
}
```

